{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 火库｜zn ↔ x｜冻结研究配图重组\n\n**直接来源：** `00_研究建库冻结备份_2026-08-03` 所指向的原研究 Canvas。\n\n本文件只做五行重排：保留原编号、原名称、原参考图、原来源页；不重新研究、不另造一套图片证据。\n\n共 19 项。","x":-800,"y":-800,"width":1600,"height":480,"color":"1"},{"id":"group-yang","type":"group","label":"阳火 zn｜8项｜原研究配图","x":-980,"y":0,"width":1840,"height":2460,"color":"1"},{"id":"item-20","type":"text","text":"## 20｜卷曲帘幕刘海\n\n![](https://therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/10-curtain-bangs-for-curly-hair.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/curtain-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"1"},{"id":"item-30","type":"text","text":"## 30｜卷曲瓶颈刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/yXFG2wy7t1S3Gf1SMlNzzyYujUE%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/ZazieBeetzAmySussman-e1e10dc17cff4bdab3a3f7d624e032c3.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/bottleneck-bangs-8765309)","x":-320,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"1"},{"id":"item-51","type":"text","text":"## 51｜卷曲Baby刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/iBkToB-Jq1Xa_He2KSNx1wdWmYw%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/GettyImages-1058978346-a4ea132c13b9483b9af432ca87e84cb4.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/ways-to-try-baby-bangs-11813484)","x":260,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"1"},{"id":"item-65","type":"text","text":"## 65｜经典Birkin刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/23-brunette-lob-with-birkin-bangs.jpg?resize=1080%2C1350&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/types-of-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"1"},{"id":"item-70","type":"text","text":"## 70｜卷曲Birkin刘海\n\n![](https://media.vogue.co.uk/photos/66bdddd16c5ab0bcc4bcd9df/master/w_1024%2Cc_limit/paolalct_1715632825_3367294654753257176_1774596107.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.vogue.co.uk/gallery/french-bangs-inspiration)","x":-320,"y